<title>USA: AMETEK to buy Technitrol's Chatillon.</title>
<headline>AMETEK to buy Technitrol's Chatillon.</headline>
<dateline>PAOLI, Pa. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMETEK Inc said on Thursday that it signed a definitive agreement to buy for $34 million in cash the Test &amp; Measurement Products businesses of Technitrol Inc.</p>
<p>With annual sales of $30 million, Test &amp; Measurement manufactures measurement and testing devices, which are marketed under the Chatillon and Lloyd brand names.</p>
<p>AMETEK chief executive Walter Blankley said, &quot;The synergies of this acquisition combined with our current business build critical mass for a significant position in the $800-million global Force Measurement Market.&quot;</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
